# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# sharpFSI .gitignore
#
# Principle: commit the *source* (the 10 .py modules), the *documentation*
# (README.md, COMPARISON_REPORT.md), the *cited summary logs* (so every number
# in the report is traceable without re-running anything) and a curated set of
# *figures*. Everything else is a large, regenerable by-product of a run, and
# can be reproduced with the commands in README.md section 1.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.Python
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# --- generated per-run data (bulk: many MB of vortex/POD histories) ---
# (the one exception, fsi_history_bem_stall_tsr1p00.txt, is committed because
#  COMPARISON_REPORT.md section 6 bins it and moment_model_check.py reads it)
fsi_history_bem_*.txt
!fsi_history_bem_stall_tsr1p00.txt
fsi_validation_history*.txt
bem_history*.txt

# --- figures are generated, so ignore them by default ... ---
*.png

# --- ... except the ones the documentation embeds (README.md, COMPARISON_REPORT.md) ---
!verify_solver_plots.png
!verify_static.png
!verify_wagner.png
!verify_convergence.png
!verify_structural.png
!verify_stall.png
!verify_kinematics.png
!verify_wake_drag.png
!verify_deadpoint.png
!verify_vortex_moment.png
!moment_model_check.png
!design_study_cw.png
!design_study_tsr.png
!comparison_fsi_vs_bem_potential_tsr1p00.png
!comparison_fsi_vs_bem_stall_tsr1p00.png
!comparison_fsi_vs_bem_stall_tsr3p00.png
!comparison_fsi_vs_bem_potential_tsr3p00.png

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
